## Capacitor native projects (ios/, android/) are COMMITTED (Capacitor convention):
## they hold real config (Info.plist, entitlements, gradle, icons). Their own
## .gitignores already exclude Pods / Gradle build output, the synced web assets
## (ios/App/App/public, android/app/src/main/assets/public) and generated configs
## (capacitor.config.json, capacitor.plugins.json).